    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "A_ev_body",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 510,
      "width": 710,
      "height": 100,
      "text": "1. Client submits debit of $500 to Primary ledger\n2. Primary writes and BLOCKS (does not ack yet)\n3. Primary synchronously replicates to Replica A & B\n4. Primary waits for write-quorum acknowledgment\n5. Only then returns success to client (~50-150ms)",
      "originalText": "1. Client submits debit of $500 to Primary ledger\n2. Primary writes and BLOCKS (does not ack yet)\n3. Primary synchronously replicates to Replica A & B\n4. Primary waits for write-quorum acknowledgment\n5. Only then returns success to client (~50-150ms)",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "strokeColor": "#22c55e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "seed": 100045,
      "version": 1,
